    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d320">

                <pb facs="0526" n="430" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg430"/>

                <head>No. 320.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Nelson to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 6, 1872</date>.
                        (Received June 28.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 581.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith a copy
                    and translation (A and B) of a prolongation of the Tehuantepec Railway and Canal
                    concession, extending its time for three years longer, which was granted to the
                    Tehuantepec company by the Mexican congress on the 22d of May last.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS H. NELSON.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d320-a1.xml" xpointer="d320-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
